<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'FAQs | D.E.T System', page: 'faqs' }) %>

<style>
    .faq-page-header {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 60px 0 40px;
    }
    .faq-page-header h1 {
        font-size: 42px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #fff;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .faq-page-header h1 span {
        color: var(--det-green);
    }
    .faq-page-header p {
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 16px;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .faq-container {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto 80px;
        padding: 0 20px;
    }
    .faq-item {
        background: var(--det-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--det-border);
        border-radius: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        transition: border-color 0.3s;
    }
    .faq-item:hover {
        border-color: rgba(176,191,150,0.5);
    }
    .faq-question {
        padding: 18px 24px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #ffffff;
        user-select: none;
        background: rgba(176,191,150,0.03);
    }
    .faq-question i {
        color: var(--det-green);
        transition: transform 0.3s;
        font-size: 12px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        margin-left: 12px;
    }
    .faq-item.open .faq-question i {
        transform: rotate(180deg);
    }
    .faq-answer {
        max-height: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        transition: max-height 0.4s ease, padding 0.4s ease;
        padding: 0 24px;
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .faq-item.open .faq-answer {
        max-height: 2000px;
        padding: 0 24px 18px;
    }
    .faq-answer ul {
        padding-left: 20px;
        margin: 8px 0;
    }
    .faq-answer ul li {
        padding: 2px 0;
        color: #cbd5e1;
    }
    .faq-answer strong {
        color: #fff;
    }

    .faq-cta {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 40px 0 60px;
    }
    .faq-cta h3 {
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 22px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .faq-cta p {
        color: #94a3b8;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .faq-cta a {
        display: inline-block;
        background: var(--det-green);
        color: var(--det-dark);
        padding: 12px 28px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 14px;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .faq-cta a:hover {
        background: var(--det-green-hover);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .faq-page-header h1 { font-size: 30px; }
        .faq-question { font-size: 13px; padding: 16px 18px; }
    }
</style>

<div class="container">
    <div class="faq-page-header">
        <h1>Frequently Asked <span>Questions</span></h1>
        <p>Everything you need to know about D.E.T — answered clearly.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="faq-container">
    
    <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            Do I need trading experience to use D.E.T?
            <i class="bi bi-chevron-down"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
            <p><strong>Not necessarily.</strong></p>
            <p>One of the greatest advantages of D.E.T is that it removes much of the complexity that has traditionally made trading difficult.</p>
            <p>For years, traders have spent countless hours studying candlestick patterns, market structure, technical indicators, trading psychology, money management, and complex financial terminology. D.E.T brings these institutional-grade capabilities together into one intelligent interface called <strong>CornerStore</strong>, presenting the information you need in a simple, organised, and practical way.</p>
            <p>If you prefer to trade manually, D.E.T becomes your intelligent co-pilot. It continuously analyses the markets, displays developing trends, provides trader analytics, highlights opportunities, and helps you make more informed trading decisions.</p>
            <p>The moment you manually place a Buy or Sell order, D.E.T immediately begins working alongside you by automatically managing important trading functions such as:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Float size calculations</li>
                <li>Position sizing</li>
                <li>Stop Loss placement</li>
                <li>Take Profit management</li>
                <li>Trailing Stop management</li>
                <li>Risk Bands</li>
                <li>Money Management</li>
                <li>Real-time risk recalibration</li>
                <li>Blocking manual trades that conflict with the prevailing market trend (where enabled)</li>
            </ul>
            <p>All of this happens in real time with quantum-speed processing.</p>
            <p>If you choose to activate <strong>Automation</strong>, D.E.T takes over trade execution after you have accepted the D.E.T Terms & Conditions.</p>
            <p>Whether you are sleeping, travelling, at work, spending time with family, or on holiday, D.E.T continues monitoring and executing trades according to its predefined trading rules and risk-management framework.</p>
            <p><strong>This does not eliminate market risk.</strong></p>
            <p>Trading remains a high-risk activity, and losses—including the loss of your entire trading capital—are possible. D.E.T does not guarantee profits. It is a sophisticated decision-support and automation system designed to help remove emotional decision-making, improve execution discipline, and provide institutional-grade trading capabilities.</p>
            <p><strong>So, can someone with no previous trading experience use D.E.T?</strong></p>
            <p>Yes. Whether you choose manual trading with D.E.T as your intelligent co-pilot, or activate full automation, D.E.T dramatically reduces the learning curve by placing years of trading research, market analysis, and institutional decision support at your fingertips. D.E.T has levelled the playing field.</p>
        </div>
    </div>


        <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            What do I need before starting with D.E.T?
            <i class="bi bi-chevron-down"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                <div style="background: rgba(176,191,150,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(176,191,150,0.15); border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; text-align: center;">
                    <i class="bi bi-windows" style="font-size: 24px; color: var(--det-green); display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;"></i>
                    <span style="color: #fff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px;">MT5 Trading Platform</span>
                </div>
                <div style="background: rgba(176,191,150,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(176,191,150,0.15); border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; text-align: center;">
                    <i class="bi bi-laptop" style="font-size: 24px; color: var(--det-green); display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;"></i>
                    <span style="color: #fff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px;">Laptop or Desktop</span>
                </div>
                <div style="background: rgba(176,191,150,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(176,191,150,0.15); border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; text-align: center;">
                    <i class="bi bi-download" style="font-size: 24px; color: var(--det-green); display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;"></i>
                    <span style="color: #fff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px;">Download & Install D.E.T</span>
                </div>
                <div style="background: rgba(176,191,150,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(176,191,150,0.15); border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; text-align: center;">
                    <i class="bi bi-gear" style="font-size: 24px; color: var(--det-green); display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;"></i>
                    <span style="color: #fff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px;">Choose Your Trading Mode</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p style="margin-top: 8px;">You can trade with D.E.T in two ways:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Manual Trading</strong> — D.E.T works as your intelligent co-pilot, assisting with risk management, stop loss, take profit, and trade protection while you make the decisions.</li>
                <li><strong>Automated Trading</strong> — D.E.T takes over trade execution based on predefined trading rules and risk-management frameworks, operating 24/7 even when you're away from your computer.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>



    <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            How does D.E.T help if I trade manually?
            <i class="bi bi-chevron-down"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>The moment you place a Buy or Sell order, D.E.T can immediately assist by applying your predefined trading rules, including:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Float Size Calculations</li>
                <li>Automatic Stop Loss</li>
                <li>Automatic Take Profit</li>
                <li>Money Management</li>
                <li>Risk Band Allocation</li>
                <li>Trailing Stop Management</li>
                <li>Wrong-Trend Blocking</li>
                <li>Real-time Position Monitoring</li>
            </ul>
            <p>All of this happens within fractions of a second, helping remove much of the manual work that normally requires years of trading experience.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            What happens if my account doubles?
            <i class="bi bi-chevron-down"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
            Our built-in <strong>Zero-Hedge Protocol</strong> automatically locks your account when your equity doubles, securing your profits. You can then withdraw your initial capital and continue trading with pure profit, or upgrade to a higher tier.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            Does D.E.T guarantee profits?
            <i class="bi bi-chevron-down"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
            <p><strong>No.</strong></p>
            <p>Trading is inherently high risk. Markets can move unexpectedly, and it is possible to lose part or all of your trading capital. D.E.T is not designed to eliminate market risk.</p>
            <p>Its purpose is to reduce human error, remove emotional decision-making, apply disciplined execution, and provide institutional-grade decision support that was historically available only to the world's most sophisticated market participants.</p>
            <p><strong>D.E.T doesn't eliminate risk. It helps you manage it with greater precision.</strong></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            Why is D.E.T not available on mobile phones?
            <i class="bi bi-chevron-down"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>For the best trading experience, D.E.T is currently available on <strong>laptops and desktop computers only</strong>. Mobile phone support is not yet available.</p>
            <p>D.E.T is built around <strong style="color: var(--det-green);">CornerStore</strong> — its professional trading dashboard, installed on your laptop or desktop computer. CornerStore displays real-time analytics, market movements, trade opportunities, alerts, and decision-support tools within a single, easy-to-use interface, giving traders the workspace needed to monitor the markets efficiently and make informed trading decisions.</p>
            <p>For that reason, mobile phone support is not yet available.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            Can I monitor my trading account from my mobile phone?
            <i class="bi bi-chevron-down"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
            <p><strong>Yes.</strong> You can use your broker's mobile trading application to monitor your trading account, including your balance, equity, open positions, account history, and running profit or loss.</p>
            <p>This allows you to stay informed and keep track of your trades wherever you are. However, <strong style="color: var(--det-green);">active trading and the full D.E.T experience</strong> are currently available on laptops and desktop computers only.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            Which payment methods are accepted?
            <i class="bi bi-chevron-down"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
            We accept EcoCash, OneMoney, and standard bank transfers through Paynow — Zimbabwe's leading payment gateway. All transactions are secure and processed instantly.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            Is my money safe?
            <i class="bi bi-chevron-down"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
            Your trading capital stays in your own MT5 broker account. The D.E.T EA only executes trades — it never has access to withdraw funds. Plus, our Zero-Hedge Protocol locks profits automatically when your account doubles.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            Can D.E.T trade while I'm away?
            <i class="bi bi-chevron-down"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Yes. If you choose <strong>Automation Mode</strong>, D.E.T takes over trade execution after you have accepted the D.E.T Terms & Conditions and activated automation.</p>
            <p>Once activated, D.E.T continuously monitors the markets and executes trades according to your selected trader type and predefined trading rules — whether you are sleeping, travelling, at work, on holiday, or away from your trading desk. D.E.T continues operating until you decide otherwise.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>

<div class="faq-cta">
    <h3>Still have questions?</h3>
    <p>Our support team is ready to help you.</p>
    <a href="/pricing">Get Started with D.E.T</a>
</div>

